Hi Omnia,

Thanks for running the 4.4.0 release.

I did the following to validate RC3:

- Verified checksums (md5/sha1/sha512) and GPG signatures
  - Artifacts: source, binary, site-docs, RELEASE_NOTES
  - Signed by Omnia Ibrahim <omnia@apache.org>
  - Key 1817905E3B2708B11A24B88E9AFA6F66CC8C3534
- Built from source with JDK 17
  - Ran the core, clients and streams unit tests
- Ran quickstarts from the bundled site-docs against the binary distributio=
n
  - Broker quickstart
  - Kafka Streams WordCount quickstart
  - Used both the classic and streams (KIP-1071) group protocols
- Ran the same quickstarts against the Docker images
  - apache/kafka:4.4.0-rc3
  - apache/kafka-native:4.4.0-rc3
- Checked shipped jar versions for the dependency and CVE bumps
  - jackson-databind 2.21.7
  - log4j 2.25.5
  - jetty 12.0.39
  - lz4-java 1.11.2
  - zstd-jni 1.5.7-17
- Exercised these KIPs by hand against local clusters
  - Streams:
    - KIP-892 (WordCount with EOS and transactional state stores)
    - KIP-1071 static membership
    - KIP-1245, KIP-1283, KIP-1284, KIP-1321
    - KIP-1331, KIP-1340, KIP-1356, KIP-1357
  - Broker:
    - KIP-1170, KIP-1191, KIP-1200, KIP-1220
    - KIP-1232, KIP-1241 (configs only), KIP-1276
    - KIP-1291, KIP-1301, KIP-1312, KIP-1323
  - Clients:
    - KIP-909, KIP-1242, KIP-1299
    - KIP-1319 (smoke test)

+1 (binding)

