Hello Kafka users, developers and client-developers,

This is the second candidate for release of Apache Kafka 4.3.2.

This is a bugfix release in 4.3 line.

Release notes for the 4.3.2 release:
=
https://dist.apache.org/repos/dist/dev/kafka/4.3.2-rc1/RELEASE_NOTES.html =
<https://dist.apache.org/repos/dist/dev/kafka/4.3.2-rc/RELEASE_NOTES.html>=


Please download, test and vote by Tuesday, October 13th, 9am PT

Kafka's KEYS file containing PGP keys we use to sign the release:
https://downloads.apache.org/kafka/KEYS

* Release artifacts to be voted upon (source and binary):
https://dist.apache.org/repos/dist/dev/kafka/4.3.2-rc1/ =
<https://dist.apache.org/repos/dist/dev/kafka/4.3.2-rc/>

* Docker release artifacts to be voted upon:
apache/kafka:4.3.2-rc1
apache/kafka-native:4.3.2-rc1

* Maven artifacts to be voted upon:
https://repository.apache.org/content/groups/staging/org/apache/kafka/

* Javadoc:
=
https://dist.apache.org/repos/dist/dev/kafka/4.3.2-rc1/javadoc/index.html

* Tag to be voted upon (off 4.3 branch) is the 4.3.2 tag:
https://github.com/apache/kafka/releases/tag/4.3.2-rc1

* Documentation:
https://kafka.apache.org/43/documentation.html

* Protocol:
https://kafka.apache.org/43/design/protocol

* Successful CI builds for the 4.3 branch:
Unit/integration tests: =
https://github.com/apache/kafka/actions/runs/37632175708
System tests: https://jenkins.opensource4you.tw/job/kafka-e2e/967/

* Docker Image Github Actions Pipeline for 4.3 branch:
Docker Build Test Pipeline (JVM): =
https://github.com/apache/kafka/actions/runs/37769307897
Docker Build Test Pipeline (Native): =
https://github.com/apache/kafka/actions/runs/37769370154

The native pipeline is green. The JVM pipeline reports four HIGH =
findings,=20
all denial-of-service issues in Jackson 2.21.6 and all fixed in 2.21.7:=20=

CVE-2026-89407, CVE-2026-89425 (jackson-core) CVE-2026-91776, =
CVE-2026-91777 (jackson-databind)
I have not picked up the Jackson bump for this bugfix release, but am =
happy to roll another=20
RC if the community prefers to include it.

Thanks,
Jiunn-Yang Huang=

