Hello Kafka users, developers and client-developers,

This is the fourth candidate for release of Apache Kafka 4.3.2.

This is a bugfix release in 4.3 line.

Release notes for the 4.3.2 release:
=
https://dist.apache.org/repos/dist/dev/kafka/4.3.2-rc3/RELEASE_NOTES.html =
<https://dist.apache.org/repos/dist/dev/kafka/4.3.2-rc/RELEASE_NOTES.html>=


Please download, test and vote by Wednesday, October 14th, 9am PT

Kafka's KEYS file containing PGP keys we use to sign the release:
https://downloads.apache.org/kafka/KEYS

* Release artifacts to be voted upon (source and binary):
https://dist.apache.org/repos/dist/dev/kafka/4.3.2-rc3/ =
<https://dist.apache.org/repos/dist/dev/kafka/4.3.2-rc/>

* Docker release artifacts to be voted upon:
apache/kafka:4.3.2-rc3
apache/kafka-native:4.3.2-rc3

* Maven artifacts to be voted upon:
https://repository.apache.org/content/groups/staging/org/apache/kafka/

* Javadoc:
=
https://dist.apache.org/repos/dist/dev/kafka/4.3.2-rc3/javadoc/index.html

* Tag to be voted upon (off 4.3 branch) is the 4.3.2-rc3 tag:
https://github.com/apache/kafka/releases/tag/4.3.2-rc3

* Documentation:
https://kafka.apache.org/43/documentation.html

* Protocol:
https://kafka.apache.org/43/design/protocol

* Successful CI builds for the 4.3 branch:
Unit/integration tests: =
https://github.com/apache/kafka/actions/runs/38121352442
System tests: [will provide it soon]

* Successful Docker Image Github Actions Pipeline for 4.3 branch:
Docker Build Test Pipeline (JVM): =
https://github.com/apache/kafka/actions/runs/38107480297
Docker Build Test Pipeline (Native): =
https://github.com/apache/kafka/actions/runs/38107494688

Thanks,
Jiunn-Yang Huang=

--Apple-Mail=_280876D2-4278-4E23-A69F-24DAEB5CDF25--

